            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Robert"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Good quick recipe for dipping sauce . I added some oyster sauce, spoonful of sambol chili garlic paste, and a squeeze of Dijon mustard to thicken and it was perfect!",
            "datePublished": "2025-12-30T00:59:07.899Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "alicat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great dipping sauce! I needed a super-quick sauce for egg rolls and this literally took about a minute to toss together. I'd just run out of rice vinegar so I substituted plain white vinegar instead and it was still great! Also, some of us put some sriracha sauce in to heat it up... good with or without. Thanks!",
            "datePublished": "2011-03-15T15:44:15.590Z"
          },
          {
