            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Hope Marie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is THE sauce for egg rolls and fried wontons! I made it according to the measurements on the recipe, however, I added about a tablespoon of oyster sauce and a little bit of sugar.. Either way, the BEST sauce I've tried for DIY sauce! Thanks so much for the recipe! :)",
